  "question": {
    "text": "For the complex number&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> satisfying the condition <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,&nbsp;the maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>|</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>|</mo></mrow></math><br /><br />Now, for maximum or minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> LHS inequality will hold true as it corresponds to the two complex numbers being on opposite sides of origin.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mrow><mo>|</mo> <mi>z</mi> <mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac> <mn>2</mn> <mrow> <mrow><mo>|</mo> <mi>z</mi> <mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </math> (without loss of generality let LHS &gt; 0)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo> <mi>z</mi> <mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt> <mrow> <mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo> <mi>z</mi> <mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math></p>"
  }
